  "baccaratRulesPayouts": "Player 1:1 · Banker 0.95:1 (exact to the cent) · Tie 8:1 (Player and Banker returned) · Player Pair, Banker Pair 11:1.",
  "baccaratRulesRound": "20 s of betting, then the deal: animated squeeze, third card laid sideways. Trends shown: Bead Plate and Big Road.",
